    "Lines":  {
                  "1":  {
                            "Text":  [
                                         "{givequest H38F}",
                                         "{completequest H38F}",
                                         "Welcome ashore, my friend. Lucky thing the shuttle landed in the water, huh?",
                                         "{delay 1}\\nAnyway, I\u0027m Brandon Thorn, I\u0027m a paramedic here at the ICC Shuttleport. I can provide you with the standard issue gear for all newcomers to Rubi-Ka. Because I use nanobots to assemble the equipment straight into your inventory. {emote}You can open your inventory by pressing \u0027i\u0027 or using the inventory icon on your gui.{/emote}\\nI hope you feel good enough to start working, we need all the help we can get here!",
                                         "{delay 2}\\nAre you ready?"
                                     ],
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "yes",
                                            "explain_skills"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "2":  {
                            "Text":  [
                                         "Your skills define what you can do, and how good you are at it. Items require different skills to use or equip. The nano programs you will need have skill requirements for uploading and executing them, and many actions demand a certain amount in a specific skill or two to have any chance of succeeding. As you get more experienced on Rubi-Ka you get more improvement points to spend on your skills.",
                                         "{delay 3}\\n{emote}Improvement points are granted every time you level. You can access your skill view to learn more from the left hand menu or by pressing \u0027U\u0027.{/emote}"
                                     ],
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "check_equipment",
                                            "how_fight"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "3":  {
                            "Text":  "{emote}To look at your inventory, open it by using the menu on the bottom left side of the screen, or by pressing \u0027I\u0027. To examine a specific item, hold down Shift and left-click on the item. Equip your selected weapon by right-clicking it.{/emote}",
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "shuttle",
                                            "what_skills",
                                            "how_fight"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "4":  {
                            "Text":  "It was shot down, by aliens I imagine.  They seem to be everywhere these days, even on this island.  Lucky thing the shuttle didn\u0027t explode, and that you landed in the water.",
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "aliens"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "5":  {
                            "Text":  [
                                         "Yes.  Lots of them.  One of their ships landed here, and aliens are pouring out.  They have overrun the docks and the main landing platform. ",
                                         "{delay 3} The guards are still here, holding the aliens back, but apart from some key personnel everybody else has been evacuated by now."
                                     ],
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "help_aliens"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "6":  {
                            "Text":  "{delay 1}Hello there, are you ready to help me?",
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "yes",
                                            "explain_skills"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "7":  {
                            "Text":  [
                                         "{givequest L5G4}",
                                         "{delay 1}Well, first have a look around, and see whether you can find one of each of the four species living around where we stand now, then return to me.",
                                         "{delay 2}\\n{emote}You got a new mission. To look at the mission, open the mission window which can be done by either using the menu on the bottom right side of the screen, or by pressing CTRL+4. {/emote}"
                                     ]
                        },
                  "8":  {
                            "Text":  [
                                         "{completequest T8Q1}",
                                         "So, how did it go?"
                                     ],
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "found_creatures",
                                            "explain_skills"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "9":  {
                            "Text":  [
                                         "Great!",
                                         "{delay 2}\\nNormally we would use a holo chamber simulation to test your reflexes and get you used to the standard equipment, but since this isn\u0027t possible at the moment, I will have to ask you to fight some of the local wildlife to prove your fitness, I hope that\u0027s all right. "
                                     ],
                            "Replies":  [
                                            "sure"
                                        ]
                        },
                  "10":  {
                             "Text":  [
                                          "Good.",
                                          "{delay 1} ",
                                          "{givequest 91S8}",
                                          "{delay 1} What you should do is kill one of each of the four creatures you located. Check your equipment and skills before starting out. It will make handling the local wildlife a lot easier."
                                      ],
                             "Replies":  [
                                             "check_equipment",
                                             "what_skills",
                                             "how_fight"
                                         ]
                         },
                  "11":  {
                             "Text":  [
                                          "{completequest Q5V8}",
                                          "So, how did it go?"
                                      ],
                             "Replies":  [
                                             "killed_animals"
                                         ]
                         },
                  "12":  {
                             "Text":  [
                                          "Well done.",
                                          "{delay 1}{givequest MWTD}",
                                          "\\nNow, this belt I have here is something I have found, not quite sure if it is of any use, but take it to Equipment Vendor Antonio Stacklund and he\u0027ll help identify it for you.",
                                          "{delay 1} He has a few items for sale that you might be interested in too.",
                                          "{delay 1}\\nOh, and if you have any sizable monster parts, I would be interested in getting a few..."
                                      ],
                             "Replies":  [
                                             "monster_parts",
                                             "dont_have_any",
                                             "find_stacklund"
                                         ]
                         },
                  "13":  {
                             "Text":  "Hello there, how may I help you?",
                             "Replies":  [
                                             "found_creatures"
                                         ]
                         },
                  "14":  {
                             "Text":  "Hello there, how may I help you?",
                             "Replies":  [
                                             "what_now",
                                             "belt",
                                             "have_3_parts",
                                             "killed_animals"
                                         ]
                         },
                  "15":  {
                             "Text":  [
                                          "Well, if you haven\u0027t already, you could go talk to the ICC Bio-Inspector. I\u0027m sure he will find something for you to do, he\u0027s always swamped. Later, when you have your bearings of the island, you could head up to the platform and talk to the Shuttleport manager.",
                                          "{givequest HYIY}"
                                      ],
                             "Replies":  [
                                             "be_right_back",
                                             "find_inspector",
                                             "have_parts_here"
                                         ]
                         },
                  "16":  {
                             "Text":  "Excellent!{opentrade}"
                         },
                  "17":  {
                             "Text":  [
                                          "Thank you.  Excellent work!  Here are some first aid kits for the trouble.  If you get more parts, please don\u0027t hesitate to bring them to me.",
                                          "{spawn TALA level}",
                                          "{spawn BSNR level}",
                                          "{spawn SFAK level}",
                                          "{spawn SNKT level}"
                                      ],
                             "Replies":  [
                                             "found_other_things",
                                             "what_now"
                                         ]
                         },
                  "fight":  {
                                "Text":  "{emote}Select an enemy by clicking on it, then press \u0027 Q \u0027 or use the attack button to start fighting. Keep an eye on your health, and sit down with \u0027 X \u0027 afterwards to recover faster.{/emote}",
                                "Replies":  [
                                                "explain_skills",
                                                "shuttle"
                                            ]
                            },
                  "help":  {
                               "Text":  "You certainly can. Start with the wildlife around here and work your way up. Manager Travis Molen up by the control tower has more work for newcomers.",
                               "Replies":  [
                                               "check_equipment",
                                               "how_fight"
                                           ]
                           },
                  "monster_parts_info":  {
                                             "Text":  "Those little orange blobs of flesh that drop off almost everything on this island. Bring me three at a time and I\u0027ll turn them into first aid kits and nano kits for you.",
                                             "Replies":  [
                                                             "have_parts_here",
                                                             "dont_have_any"
                                                         ]
                                         },
                  "no_parts":  {
                                   "Text":  "No worries. Almost every creature here drops them. Come back when you have three.",
                                   "Replies":  [
                                                   "find_stacklund",
                                                   "what_now"
                                               ]
                               },
                  "stacklund":  {
                                    "Text":  "Head west along the shore and go through the tunnel, then up the ramps. Antonio Stacklund is at the very top.",
                                    "Replies":  [
                                                    "what_now"
                                                ]
                                },
                  "belt_info":  {
                                    "Text":  "Take it to Equipment Vendor Antonio Stacklund. He knows more about that kind of gear than I do.",
                                    "Replies":  [
                                                    "find_stacklund",
                                                    "what_now"
                                                ]
                                },
                  "bye":  {
                              "Text":  "See you soon, then.{close}"
                          },
                  "inspector":  {
                                    "Text":  "The ICC Bio-Inspector is just along the beach to the west, around 835 by 755. You can\u0027t miss him.",
                                    "Replies":  [
                                                    "what_now"
                                                ]
                                },
                  "other_things":  {
                                       "Text":  "Antonio Stacklund will buy most of what you find. And the Shuttleport manager up on the platform will want to meet you once you know your way around.",
                                       "Replies":  [
                                                       "what_now",
                                                       "find_stacklund"
                                                   ]
                                   }
